    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the Wilson, Kentucky, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1952; aerial photographs from 1988; field checked in 1976; photo revised in 1993; last revised in 1993; printed in 1993.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.9 x 27.3 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
